longdesc The package mailmerge provides an interface to produce text
longdesc from a template, where fields are replaced by actual data, as
longdesc in a database. The package may be used to produce several
longdesc letters from a template, certificates or other such documents.
longdesc It allows access to the entry number, number of entries and so
longdesc on.
